trf7970a_shutdown() does not handle that state:

drivers/nfc/trf7970a.c:trf7970a_shutdown() {
	switch (trf->state) {
	...
	case TRF7970A_ST_IDLE:
	case TRF7970A_ST_IDLE_RX_BLOCKED:
